Pakistan wasn't water.

7
00:00:07,918 --> 00:00:09,740
It was information.

8
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:11,239
The Indus Waters Treaty

9
00:00:11,239 --> 00:00:12,614
of 1960 divided six

10
00:00:12,614 --> 00:00:14,024
rivers between the two

11
00:00:14,024 --> 00:00:14,754
