29
00:00:38,408 --> 00:00:40,426
That exchange has ended.

30
00:00:40,436 --> 00:00:41,968
Eighty percent of Pakistan's

31
00:00:41,968 --> 00:00:43,801
irrigated agriculture depends on

32
00:00:43,801 --> 00:00:45,327
these rivers, a sector

33
00:00:45,327 --> 00:00:46,554
worth a quarter of

34
00:00:46,554 --> 00:00:47,632
