41
00:00:55,493 --> 00:00:57,018
So two nuclear-armed neighbours

42
00:00:57,018 --> 00:00:58,492
now manage a shared,

43
00:00:58,492 --> 00:01:00,174
climate-stressed river system with

44
00:01:00,174 --> 00:01:01,496
